  "steps": [
    "Warm the coconut oil in a wide pan and fry the curry paste for a minute until aromatic.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and stock, stir to combine and bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add the tofu, pepper, green beans and baby corn. Simmer for 12 minutes until the vegetables are tender but still vibrant.",
    "Season with soy sauce and lime juice, tasting as you go for that salty-sour-sweet balance.",
    "Tear over the herbs and serve with jasmine rice."
  ],
  "notes": "Check your curry paste — many contain fish sauce or shrimp, so look for a clearly labelled vegan one. Add at the end: a teaspoon of sugar if it needs rounding."
}
